Starting:

docker-compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose-infra.yml up -d --build

Testing for PowerShell:

$orderId = (Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "http://localhost:8003/order/create" -Method Post -Body "Test order" -ContentType "text/plain").order_id
Start-Sleep -Seconds 3
$order = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "http://localhost:8003/order/$orderId"
$order | Format-List